  "audit_findings": [
    "Parametric Ω_NAME emergents (e.g. Ω_safe_judgment) remain multi-token unless individually pre-registered. The Ω_ prefix morpheme is in vocab; full names fall through to char tokens under frozen mode. Path D corpus generation should pre-register the Ω_ names that appear in the corpus before freezing.",
    "Cognitive Fractal index digits (3, 8, 5, 2 inside ⟨3:8:5:2⟩) tokenize as char tokens because the spec did not list digits 0-9 in the 7-category coverage. Compiler grammar treats them as integer literals (TokenKind.NUMBER); future work may add 0-9 as single tokens.",
    "Backward compatibility verified: existing v1 tokenizer.json files load and tokenize identically — the dynamic regex includes the compound `^N^D` and `_{Fk}` patterns only when the corresponding v2 tokens are present in vocab."
